## Improvements Implemented

### 1. Input Validation ✓
```javascript
// SECURE: Validate and sanitize all inputs
const validateUserId = (id) => {
  const numId = parseInt(id, 10);
  if (isNaN(numId) || numId < 1 || numId > 1000000) {
    return { valid: false, error: 'Invalid user ID' };
  }
  return { valid: true, value: numId };
};

const sanitizeQueryParams = (params) => {
  const sanitized = {};
  for (const [key, value] of Object.entries(params)) {
    if (typeof value === 'string') {
      sanitized[key] = validator.escape(value.trim());
    }
  }
  return sanitized;
};
```

**Benefits:**
- XSS prevention through escaping
- Type validation prevents injection
- Range checks prevent resource exhaustion

---

### 2. Comprehensive Error Handling ✓
```javascript
// SECURE: Global error handler
app.use((err, req, res, next) => {
  // Log internally (with full details)
  console.error('Error:', err.message, err.stack);

  // Return safe message to client
  const message = process.env.NODE_ENV === 'production' 
    ? 'An internal server error occurred'
    : err.message;

  res.status(err.statusCode || 500).json({
    error: 'Internal server error',
    message
  });
});

// Try-catch in routes
app.get('/users', (req, res, next) => {
  try {
    // Route logic
  } catch (error) {
    next(error);  // Pass to error handler
  }
});
```

**Benefits:**
