## 6. HTTP Header Injection

### Attack Example
```bash
# Attacker tries to inject headers
curl -X POST http://localhost:3000/users \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "name": "User\r\nSet-Cookie: sessionid=malicious",
    "email": "test@test.com"
  }'
```

### Protection in Improved Code
```javascript
// Input sanitization removes newlines and special characters
const sanitizeInput = (input) => {
  if (typeof input === 'string') {
    return validator.escape(input).replace(/[\r\n]/g, '');
  }
  return input;
};

// Helmet sets secure headers
app.use(helmet());
```

