## 9. Clickjacking

### Attack Example
```html
<!-- Attacker's malicious page -->
<iframe src="http://yourapp.com/transfer-money" 
        style="opacity:0;position:absolute;"></iframe>
<button style="position:absolute;top:100px;left:100px;">
  Click for free prize!
</button>
```

### Protection in Improved Code
```javascript
// Helmet sets X-Frame-Options header
app.use(helmet({
  frameguard: {
    action: 'deny' // or 'sameorigin'
  }
}));
```

**Result**: Browser refuses to render the page in an iframe.

